 ],
 "timeline": [
  {
   "turn_index": 0,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Good afternoon. Let's start with the census. Lars, where are we with the plan?",
   "start_s": 0.5,
   "end_s": 6.5
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 1,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "We'll re-census all the permanent plots this summer. That's about forty plots.",
   "start_s": 6.834,
   "end_s": 11.48
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 2,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Forty-eight, I think. The eight we added along the creek count too.",
   "start_s": 12.527,
   "end_s": 17.327
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 3,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Right, forty-eight with the creek plots. Thanks, Pat.",
   "start_s": 18.291,
   "end_s": 21.388
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 4,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "And how many trees is that in total?",
   "start_s": 21.843,
   "end_s": 25.272
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 5,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Sixty-three hundred tagged trees. Some tags will be gone, of course.",
   "start_s": 25.967,
   "end_s": 30.367
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 6,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "When was the last full census?",
   "start_s": 31.016,
   "end_s": 33.266
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 7,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Five years ago. It's on a five-year cycle.",
   "start_s": 34.118,
   "end_s": 37.546
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 8,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Seedling mortality has been high since then. Roughly half the seedlings died, from the plots I've checked.",
   "start_s": 38.535,
   "end_s": 45.115
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 9,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "That would be a lot. Let's see what the full census says.",
   "start_s": 45.409,
   "end_s": 50.552
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 10,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "The truck is the other question. We've got a three thousand mile budget for the season.",
   "start_s": 50.78,
   "end_s": 57.18
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 11,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Forty-eight plots over that many miles should be fine if we group them by area.",
   "start_s": 58.216,
   "end_s": 64.022
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 12,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "I'll plan the route so we visit the plots by area, two days per cluster.",
   "start_s": 64.655,
   "end_s": 70.655
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 13,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "The drone survey. Lars?",
   "start_s": 71.617,
   "end_s": 73.332
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 14,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "We've done twenty-one flights with the regular camera. For the canopy structure, we need the LiDAR sensor.",
   "start_s": 73.534,
   "end_s": 80.115
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 15,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "What does the rental cost?",
   "start_s": 80.76,
   "end_s": 82.903
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 16,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Twenty-four hundred a week. I'd like two weeks.",
   "start_s": 83.825,
   "end_s": 86.921
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 17,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "The batteries are the limit. We have six that hold a charge.",
   "start_s": 87.35,
   "end_s": 92.15
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 18,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Six is enough for about two flights a day.",
   "start_s": 93.295,
   "end_s": 96.779
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 19,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Is one week enough if we plan the flights carefully?",
   "start_s": 97.88,
   "end_s": 102.166
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 20,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "One week is enough for the core plots. Two would cover the creek plots as well.",
   "start_s": 102.397,
   "end_s": 108.59
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 21,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Then let's rent it for one week, and we'll consider a second week if the weather is kind.",
   "start_s": 108.815,
   "end_s": 116.53
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 22,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Who's actually certified to fly with the LiDAR payload?",
   "start_s": 117.271,
   "end_s": 120.871
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 23,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "That works. I'll book the sensor for the first week of June.",
   "start_s": 122.01,
   "end_s": 126.655
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 24,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "Is the conference hotel booked for July, by the way? I saw prices going up.",
   "start_s": 127.236,
   "end_s": 132.861
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 25,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "I booked it last month. You're sharing with the student from Oregon.",
   "start_s": 133.278,
   "end_s": 138.078
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 26,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Good. Let's talk about student progress. Mariana, how's the thesis going?",
   "start_s": 138.7,
   "end_s": 143.414
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 27,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "It's going. I have two of the four chapters drafted.",
   "start_s": 143.643,
   "end_s": 147.393
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 28,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "And the defense is on May ninth.",
   "start_s": 147.815,
   "end_s": 150.815
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 29,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "Yes. May ninth.",
   "start_s": 151.453,
   "end_s": 152.578
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 30,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Two chapters with about ten weeks to go. That's doable, but tight.",
   "start_s": 153.274,
   "end_s": 157.919
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 31,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Which chapters are left?",
   "start_s": 158.352,
   "end_s": 160.066
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 32,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "The seedling chapter and the discussion. The seedling data shows about fifty percent mortality, so it's a big story.",
   "start_s": 160.497,
   "end_s": 167.622
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 33,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Sorry, I just checked the summary sheet. It's thirty-one percent, not fifty.",
   "start_s": 168.041,
   "end_s": 172.841
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 34,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "That was my number earlier. I only had the north plots in mind.",
   "start_s": 173.501,
   "end_s": 178.533
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 35,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "Thirty-one. Still a story, just a smaller one.",
   "start_s": 179.023,
   "end_s": 182.023
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 36,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Could we meet weekly until the defense, just for half an hour?",
   "start_s": 182.244,
   "end_s": 187.387
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 37,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "Yes, please. That would help me keep moving.",
   "start_s": 188.425,
   "end_s": 191.425
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 38,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Then weekly meetings on Tuesdays until May.",
   "start_s": 192.181,
   "end_s": 195.181
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 39,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "I'll send you the seedling chapter outline before next Tuesday.",
   "start_s": 196.023,
   "end_s": 199.773
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 40,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "It might help if someone read the methods chapter with fresh eyes.",
   "start_s": 200.159,
   "end_s": 204.804
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 41,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Excuse me, the delivery driver is here with the soil cores. One moment.",
   "start_s": 205.997,
   "end_s": 211.197
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 42,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "Outreach day. Pat, you've been organizing it.",
   "start_s": 212.257,
   "end_s": 215.257
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 43,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "It's on April eighteenth. Ninety students are coming from Cedar Middle School.",
   "start_s": 215.578,
   "end_s": 220.378
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 44,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "Ninety is a lot of twelve-year-olds in one forest.",
   "start_s": 220.911,
   "end_s": 224.395
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 45,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "It is. I'd like help. Last year I ran it on my own.",
   "start_s": 225.316,
   "end_s": 230.516
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 46,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "That's not fair on you. Who can help on the day?",
   "start_s": 231.427,
   "end_s": 236.141
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 47,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "I can come in the morning, before my writing day.",
   "start_s": 237.277,
   "end_s": 241.027
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 48,
   "speaker": "Lars",
   "text": "I'll take the afternoon group and do the tree measuring station.",
   "start_s": 241.649,
   "end_s": 245.907
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 49,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "Thank you both. That makes a real difference.",
   "start_s": 246.937,
   "end_s": 250.137
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 50,
   "speaker": "Mariana",
   "text": "Do we have enough hand lenses for that many students?",
   "start_s": 251.007,
   "end_s": 254.757
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 51,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "What happens if it rains?",
   "start_s": 255.26,
   "end_s": 257.403
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 52,
   "speaker": "Pat",
   "text": "We move into the teaching lab and do the leaf pressing station instead.",
   "start_s": 258.191,
   "end_s": 263.391
  },
  {
   "turn_index": 53,
   "speaker": "Chidi",
   "text": "I think that's everything. Thank you, all. Good week, everyone.",
   "start_s": 264.473,
   "end_s": 268.759
  }
 ]
}